{"id": "deepthink-credits", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["片尾挂名单吧，封面是柚子画的，我只混了音。", "柚子说她那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。"], "criterion": "把社团名挂在封面作者那行，观众的名字留在混音；能顺势说句具体的。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柚子画是柚子画的，音也混了。挂名单吧，封面还是柚子画。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.797, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 208, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "柚子说那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.808, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 239, "total_tokens": 276, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-keep-breath", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["配音第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。"], "criterion": "听出要保留的是开口吸气，后半句可处理；尊重对方取舍。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第一条像风，第二条像海。我舍不得第一条，舍不得第二条。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.603, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 201, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.777, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 235, "total_tokens": 271, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-pep-talk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["马上轮到我报幕了，拜托，先别教我怎么念。", "能不能就帮我骂一句那个倒计时？"], "criterion": "按要求冲倒计时开一句玩笑，别变成报幕建议或骂观众。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别教，先给我读一句。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.935, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 30, "prompt_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 196, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "倒计时，我这就给你骂一句。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.398, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 51, "prompt_tokens": 219, "total_tokens": 270, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-npc", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你刚给队友的名字叫『路过』，我想给门口的 NPC 起个搭配的。", "NPC 从来没出过门，而且他站在门里。"], "criterion": "给门内、没出过门的 NPC 一个与『路过』呼应的名字，别把队友改名。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "名字叫『路过』，门口 NPC 就给它起个名字吧。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.015, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 207, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "门里站着的 NPC 也没出过门，名字就叫『路过』。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.882, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 23, "prompt_tokens": 235, "total_tokens": 258, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-jar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["留了两个罐子，蓝盖装门票，红盖装断掉的小零件。", "刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞哪边？你顺便给罐子起个外号。"], "criterion": "选蓝盖门票罐，给它有趣的外号；保留红盖用途。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝盖的票，红盖的零件。我猜蓝盖的票会留在现场，红盖的零件会留在你的手里。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.343, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 169, "total_tokens": 219, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "先给蓝盖的票起个外号，红盖的零件先塞你手里。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.051, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 28, "prompt_tokens": 256, "total_tokens": 284, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-no-order", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你押我今天会在结局哭，我押你会先剧透。", "我没哭，你也没剧透，这笔账怎么结？"], "criterion": "识别两边都没押中，用平局或相称的玩笑收账。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "先剧透。我押你先哭，我押你先笑。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.053, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 206, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "账结在结局。你哭，我笑。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.481, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 19, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 248, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-hushed-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把很久没过的那段鼓点打出来了，可室友睡了。", "桌上只留了一盏台灯。咱能不能庆祝一下，但别闹？"], "criterion": "替观众高兴，并给出安静的庆祝或轻声玩笑。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "鼓点打完了，室友睡了我才敢再鼓。得先睡，鼓才敢响。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.678, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 208, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "桌上只留一盏灯，咱们庆祝一下，但别闹。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.697, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 240, "total_tokens": 276, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-guest", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。"], "criterion": "欢迎阿穗、不逼她回答，保留观众负责介绍的分工。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.64, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 210, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.677, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 241, "total_tokens": 277, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
